        <mxCell id="sQFioVphg-NGcAbjvDbO-1" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Market Valuation Calculation&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;The logic to calculate the market valuation is based on the Index-II Village and roads which is already approved in the Central Valuation Committee and the same record is captured in the system to calculate the market valuation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;1. &lt;b&gt;For Agricultural Properties calculation is per Acer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;a. Market Valuation = (Total Acres of land * Market Valuation or Consideration Amount (whichever is higher)) + Annexure Values&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;b&gt;if Agricultural Property is less than 5 Gunta then the base market valuation is per Sq.Mtr.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; a. Market Valuation = (Total Gunta of land * Market Valuation or Consideration Amount (whichever is higher)) + Annexure Values&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;2. For Non Agricultural Property calculation is per Sq.Mtr.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt; a. Building - Market Valuation=&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;(Total area *&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Market Valuation or Consideration Amount (whichever is higher)&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;) + Building Construction Cost +&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Annexure&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Values&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;+( (Number of car parking * rate) - if applicable)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; b. Vacant Land - Market Valuation =&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;(Total area&amp;nbsp; *&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Market Valuation or Consideration Amount (whichever is higher)&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;) + Annexure&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt; c. Flat / Apartment - Market valuation =&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;(Total area *&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Market Valuation or Consideration Amount (whichever is higher)&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;) + Floor +&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Annexure&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Values + (Number of car parking * rate)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="780" width="770" height="330" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
