        <mxCell id="2bkolfC5FPvWnNaRvjWb-22" value="1. Government Duty After Exemption (A)&#xa;2. Surcharge Value (B)&#xa;3. Cess Value (C)&#xa;4. Denotation of Stamp Duty (D1)&#xa;5. Adjudication Fee (D2)&#xa;6. E-Stamp (D3)&#xa;7. Total Denotation of Stamp Duty (D)= (D1)+(D2)+(D3)&#xa;8. Duplicate Stamp Duty (E)&#xa;9. Total Stamp Duty (F)=((A)-(D))+(B)+(C)+(E)&#xa;10. Registration Fees (G)&#xa;11. Duplicate Registration Fees (H)&#xa;12. Total Registration Fees (I)=(G)+(H)&#xa;13. Mutation Fees (J)&#xa;14. Scanning Fees (K)&#xa;15. Private Attendance Fees (L)&#xa;16. Consenting Witness Fees (M)&#xa;17. Memo Fee (N)&#xa;18. Total Additional Fee (O)&#xa;19. Fine (P)&#xa;20. Total Amount (R)=(F)+(G)+(H)+(I)+(J)+(L)+(M)+(N)+(O)+(P)" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=15;verticalAlign=top;fontStyle=0;labelBackgroundColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="90" y="120" width="670" height="450" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
